mple Present tense  + subject + will</span> <br/> You use a comma after the condition in this form. <br/ ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">If you don't mind,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I will be with you in a moment.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "You can flip the two parts of the sentence so that the result comes first. It can be in interrogative form. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Form: </br> <span class=\"italic\">Will + subject + if + subject + Simple Present tense  ?</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will the hotel charge extra,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">if I order room service?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "&nbsp;", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Offers", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "There are different ways to make and respond to offers. Remember it is important to respond politely.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Concierge</span>: Would you like an upgrade? </br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: No, thank you. </br> <span class=\"strong\">Concierge</span>: How about a relaxing visit to the spa?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thank you!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making Offers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Offers\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I help you? </br>How about ... ? </br>Would you like ... ? </br>Here is ...</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, I'd like ... </br>OK. I want ... </br>Thank you. </br>No, thank you. </br>Hmm, I don't like ...</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "reservation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an arrangement you make in a hotel to stay there at a specific time in the future", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you have a reservation, Ma'am?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you hear at a hotel.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "queen bed", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a bed for two people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Your room includes a queen bed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "suite", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a set of rooms in a hotel; a room that includes a separate sitting area", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Would you like to upgrade to a suite?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "amenity", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that makes a place comfortable to live in", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What amenities are included with my hotel room?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "air conditioning", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a system that makes the air in a building cooler ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Each room includes air conditioning. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hair dryer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a device you use to dry hair by blowing warm air over it", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There is also a hair dryer included in the bathroom.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "sheet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a large piece of cloth that you put on a bed to lie on ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are bed sheets in the closet.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "soap", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something you use to wash your body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are bars of soap in the bathroom.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "call the front desk", "type": "name"}, {"content": "use to tell visitors at a hotel who to call", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Call the front desk, if you have any questions.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud09", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "satisfied", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happy, pleased", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: If you are not satisfied with your room, give us a call.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le08ob09aud10", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go on the Internet.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Listen to the song, \u201cTime after Time\u201d by Cyndi Lauper.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Find the lyrics for this song.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down the first conditionals in the song.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Can you find another song that has the first conditional in it?", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I listen to a song.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I find and write down the first conditional sentences. ", "type": "text"}]}]}